[00:19.39]1. In this year of goodwill
[00:22.59]by our God, all need to hear
[00:28.99]That the day of his anger
[00:32.75]will come, and it is near.
[00:35.52](Chorus)
[00:38.30]It means their life, but not just theirs;
[00:42.86]It means our own life as well.
[00:47.66]It means their life if they obey,
[00:52.38]So all the nations we must tell;
[01:07.58]We must tell.
[01:09.58]2. There’s a message to preach,
[01:11.58]so we spread it all abroad.
[01:17.56]We invite all to come and
[01:20.52]be reconciled to God.
[01:23.47](Chorus)
[01:26.42]It means their life, but not just theirs;
[01:29.37]It means our own life as well.
[01:35.37]It means their life if they obey,
[01:40.37]So all the nations we must tell;
[01:47.73]We must tell.
[01:55.08](Bridge)
[02:02.43]It’s urgent, it’s important,
[02:09.79]That people listen, learn, and live.
[02:19.39]We tell them, and we teach them;
[02:23.39]Life-giving truth we freely give.
[02:27.20](Chorus)
[02:31.00]It means their life, but not just theirs;
[02:36.00]It means our own life as well.
[02:40.00]It means their life if they obey,
[02:54.91]So all the nations we must tell;
[03:03.46]We must tell.